[{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32600200_02_0001","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32600200_02_0009","text":"舞蹈教练"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32600200_02_0010","text":"辛苦了。\n虽然是很久没看了，但真的非常棒哦。"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32600200_02_0020","text":"优秀的表达者，大多都是富有想象力的人────"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32600200_02_0030","text":"虽然我不知道你脑海中浮现的是什么，\n但你想表达的东西，确实传达给我了。"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32600200_02_0031","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32600200_02_0040","text":"啊……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32600200_02_0050","text":"────────"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32600200_02_0060","text":"对、对不起……\n我一直在看路加酱的舞蹈……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32600200_02_0061","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32600200_02_0070","text":"……路加"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32600200_02_0071","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32600200_02_0072","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32600200_02_0080","text":"路加酱，跳舞的时候\n会看到什么样的景象────？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32600200_02_0090","text":"……什么都没有。"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32600200_02_0091","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32600200_02_0092","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32600200_02_0100","text":"……什么都没有，啊……\n那岂不是……"}]
